-bowls","name":"Bols de mélange"}],"steps":[{"id":"prep-salmon","component":"salmon","title":"Préparer le saumon et le glaçage","summary":"5 min","durationMin":5,"resources":[],"details":["Sortir le saumon, retirer seulement l’excédent épais de marinade sans le rincer.","Mélanger {{use:glaze-miso}} de miso, {{use:glaze-honey}} de miel et {{use:glaze-soy}} de sauce soja dans un bol propre."],"completion":{"type":"manual","description":"Saumon prêt et glaçage propre mélangé"},"ingredientUsage":[{"id":"glaze-miso","ingredientId":"miso","quantity":15,"unit":"g","scale":{"type":"linear"}},{"id":"glaze-honey","ingredientId":"honey","quantity":15,"unit":"g","scale":{"type":"linear"}},{"id":"glaze-soy","ingredientId":"soy-sauce","quantity":10,"unit":"g","scale":{"type":"linear"}}]},{"id":"preheat-roast","component":"salmon","title":"Préchauffer le Woodfire","summary":"BAKE/ROAST 200 °C · fumée OFF","durationMin":8,"resources":["woodfire"],"woodfire":{"mode":"BAKE/ROAST","temperatureC":200,"smoke":false,"pellets":false,"support":"grill_surface","covered":false,"placement":"Surface propre légèrement huilée; peau côté support.","temperatureRangeC":[195,205]},"details":["Préchauffer en BAKE/ROAST à 200 °C, fumée désactivée."],"completion":{"type":"checkpoint","description":"Woodfire prêt"}},{"id":"roast-salmon","component":"salmon","title":"Rôtir et laquer le saumon","summary":"10–16 min · atteindre 63 °C","durationRangeMin":[10,16],"durationPlanMin":13,"dependencies":[{"stepId":"prep-salmon","relation":"after_finish","lagMin":0},{"stepId":"preheat-roast","relation":"after_finish","lagMin":0}],"resources":["woodfire"],"woodfire":{"mode":"BAKE/ROAST","temperatureC":200,"smoke":false,"pellets":false,"support":"grill_surface","covered":false,"placement":"Pavés espacés, peau côté support; ne pas couvrir.","temperatureRangeC":[195,205]},"details":["Cuire les pavés sans les empiler.","À mi-cuisson, badigeonner d’une fine couche de glaçage propre.","Contrôler le pavé le plus épais et 